Looking at the problem, we need to simulate a process where we repeatedly:  

1. Mark entire rows where all remaining cookies are the same color and there are at least two.  
2. Mark entire columns where all remaining cookies are the same color and there are at least two.  
3. Remove all marked cookies.  

We then stop when no cookies are marked in a full pass.  

